\ul\b 06-IEEE PES DAY EVENT: \par
\ulnone\b0 Date: 18 April 2024\par
Time: 11:30 P.M to 15:45 PM\par
Location: ENSIT\par
Attendees: 27 (IEEE members )\par
The IEEE PES ENSIT SBC hosted their inaugural PES Day event, "Energy Take\par
the Lead," at ENSIT. This event brought together students, researchers, and\par
professionals to focus on sustainable energy solutions. The chapter ensured\par
seamless coordination and logistics, from disseminating information to\par
managing on-site logistics. With effective online promotion by the Webmaster\par
and the Ambassador, the event featured insightful presentations, including a\par
comprehensive analysis of green solutions in Tesla's operations. Moderators\par
Ben Nasr Manar and Bouchoucha Asma facilitated engaging discussions,\par
ensuring a smooth flow of sessions. The event successfully addressed key\par
issues like green energy storage, economic solutions, and interactive member\par
sessions, marking a significant step in promoting sustainable energy practices.\par
\ul\b 07-IEEE PES DAY IN COLLABORATION :\par
\ulnone\b0 Date: 22,23,24 April 2024\par
Time: 07:00 P.M to 10:00 PM\par
Location: Google Meet\par
Attendees: 175 (IEEE members - 19 SBs in collaboration)\par
The IEEE PES ENSIT SBC played a pivotal role in the PES Day Tunisia section\par
celebration, showcasing our commitment to green energy and sustainability. As\par
part of the media team, we collaborated with the media team to create engaging\par
