discussions, managed time, engaged the audience, and addressed technical\par
issues, ensuring a balanced and informative session. Our efforts highlighted\par
our versatility and dedication to promoting sustainable energy solutions.\par
\ul\b 08-MEDIA IMPORTANCE IN ENERGY :\ulnone\b0\par
The Media plays a critical role in the energy sector by raising public\par
awareness and educating people about energy conservation,\par
renewable sources, and climate change impacts. It shapes public\par
opinion, influences policy and regulation, and promotes\par
transparency and accountability within the industry. Through\par
effective communication.It also encourages investment in innovative\par
energy solutions and manages public information during crises.\par
Additionally, it facilitates public discourse and engagement on\par
energy issues, fostering a more informed and proactive society.\par
\ul\b 09-PRE-TGM-EVENT : AI IN ENERGY :\par
\ulnone\b0 AI is significantly transforming the energy sector by enhancing\par
efficiency, sustainability, and reliability. It optimizes energy\par
consumption through smart grids and demand response systems,\par
manages renewable energy by forecasting production and optimizing\par
system performance, and improves energy storage with advanced\par
battery management. AI also aids in predictive maintenance of\par
infrastructure, streamlines energy trading by analyzing market data\par
and automating trades, and enhances smart homes and buildings\par
with integrated energy management systems. It contributes to\par
reducing the carbon footprint by monitoring emissions and\par
promoting sustainable practices, ensures grid security through\par
improved cybersecurity and resilience, and accelerates research and\par
development in energy technologies. Moreover, innovative\par
approaches like blockchain and peer-to-peer networks are\par
facilitating direct energy transactions. Despite challenges like data\par
quality, integration, and cybersecurity, AI continues to drive\par
innovation and efficiency in the energy industry. This comprehensive\par
transformation is the theme of the Pre-TGM-Event .This Event will be\par
presented By Mr Ahmed Rebai DOC ENG IN PHYSICS.The Event will\par
be hosted at 27 JUN 2024 Via Meet.\par
